  "tip": [
    {
      "id": "p1",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "t": "text",
          "v": "go 是常考单词，所以学生一定要掌握 have gone to, have been to, have been in 的用法区别："
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "p2",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "t": "strong",
          "v": "have gone to"
        },
        {
          "t": "text",
          "v": " 意为“到某地去”，说话时该人不在现场，一般不用第一人称和第二人称代词作句子的主语。"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "p3",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "t": "text",
          "v": "例如：— Where is Jim? 吉姆在哪里？"
        },
        {
          "t": "br"
        },
        {
          "t": "text",
          "v": "— He "
        },
        {
          "t": "underline",
          "v": "has gone to"
        },
        {
          "t": "text",
          "v": " England. 他去英国了。（尚未回来）"
        },
        {
          "t": "br"
        },
        {
          "t": "text",
          "v": "Mr. Wang isn’t here. He "
        },
        {
          "t": "underline",
          "v": "has gone to"
        },
        {
          "t": "text",
          "v": " Qingdao."
        },
        {
          "t": "br"
        },
        {
          "t": "text",
          "v": "王先生不在这里。他去青岛了。"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "p4",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "t": "strong",
          "v": "have been to"
        },
        {
          "t": "text",
          "v": " 意为“曾经去过某地”，现在已不在那里了。后可接表示次数的词，如 once, twice, three times 等，也可和 before, just, never, ever 等词连用。"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "p5",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "t": "text",
          "v": "例如：My father "
        },
        {
          "t": "underline",
          "v": "has been to"
        },
        {
          "t": "text",
          "v": " Beijing twice. 我父亲去过北京两次。"
        },
        {
          "t": "br"
        },
        {
          "t": "text",
          "v": "I "
        },
        {
          "t": "underline",
          "v": "have never been to"
        },
        {
          "t": "text",
          "v": " the Great Wall. 我从未去过长城。"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "p6",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "t": "strong",
          "v": "have been in"
        },
        {
          "t": "text",
          "v": " 表示“在某地待了多少时间”，句尾常接 for + 时间段，或 since + 时间点，或句首有 How long。"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "p7",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "t": "text",
          "v": "例如：I "
        },
        {
          "t": "underline",
          "v": "have been in"
        },
        {
          "t": "text",
          "v": " Shanghai for three years. 我到上海已有 3 年了。"
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
